        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Cosmos\n- People: Jānis Šipkēvics, Andris Sējāns, Juris Lisenko, Jānis Ozols, Jānis Strazdiņš, Reinis Sējāns\n- Places: Riga, Latvia\n- Concepts: a cappella band, bass voice type, classical male singing voice\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Cosmos formed in Riga, Latvia, as a Latvian a cappella band.\n- Cosmos comprised Jānis Šipkēvics and Andris Sējāns as countertenors, Juris Lisenko as tenor, Jānis Ozols as baritone, Jānis Strazdiņš as bass, and Reinis Sējāns as rhythm.\n- A bass is a type of classical male singing voice with the lowest vocal range of all voice types.",
